      "quote": "private void deliverInputEvent(QueuedInputEvent q) {",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "应用侧「把一条已排队事件送进责任链」的唯一入口。它决定从哪一级开始，以及要不要先做 KeyEvent 预处理。"
    },
    {
      "at": 2,
      "quote": "Trace.asyncTraceBegin(Trace.TRACE_TAG_VIEW, \"deliverInputEvent\",",
