      "text": "只有开启 trace 时才拼字符串——避免正常路径承担格式化成本。"
    },
    {
      "at": 6,
      "quote": "Trace.traceBegin(Trace.TRACE_TAG_VIEW, \"deliverInputEvent src=0x\"",
      "kind": "trace",
      "text": "同步切片，名字里带 source 与事件时间。"
