      "text": "source 位掩码：区分触摸/按键/轨迹球来源。"
    },
    {
      "at": 8,
      "quote": "+ q.mEvent.getEventTimeNanos() + \" id=0x\"",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "eventTimeNano 是事件发生时间（不是处理时间）。"
    },
    {
      "at": 9,
      "quote": "+ Integer.toHexString(q.mEvent.getId()));",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "id 用于和 dispatcher 侧对账。"
    },
    {
      "at": 10,
      "quote": "}",
      "kind": "note",
      "text": "关闭 trace 分支。"
    },
    {
